    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d189">

                <pb facs="0264" n="998" xml:id="pg998"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Mr.
                            Butler.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-07-19"><hi rendition="#italic">July 19,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>In opinion of Department, citizenship assumed for purpose evading extradition
                    should not be allowed that effect. If Mexican Government refuse surrender Rowe
                    on this ground, urge this view. Inform Department status case.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Adee</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Acting.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
